Third-party notices for markdown-it.mjs

markdown-it 15.0.3's browser bundle (dist/browser/markdown-it.esm.min.mjs,
vendored here as markdown-it.mjs) inlines five library packages, plus small
helpers that its bundler added: rolldown's runtime and @oxc-project/runtime's
helpers. Each license text below is copied unchanged from that package's
official npm release. markdown-it's own license is in markdown-it.LICENSE.

Versions. Each library is the newest release in markdown-it's dependency range
published before markdown-it 15.0.3. The bundle names @oxc-project/runtime
0.154.0. It does not name rolldown's exact version. 1.2.14 is the newest
release in the rolldown range of vite 8.3.4 (a markdown-it devDependency)
published before that date.

